"The file beside the scripts is no longer read.\n"
"\n"
"A backup of the scripts folder no longer includes the configuration. Add "
"this folder to your backups: {folder}."
msgstr ""
"Le impostazioni si trovano ora in {path}.\n"
"\n"
"Il file accanto agli script non viene più letto.\n"
"\n"
"Un backup della cartella degli script non include più la configurazione. "
"Aggiungete questa cartella ai backup: {folder}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Summary: uploaded {files_uploaded}, would upload {files_would_upload}, "
